Cinnamon build profiles
=======================

The default build includes Wayland support and requires GTK >= 4.18 and
GTK4 Layer Shell >= 1.0.0.

For X11-only builds on Linux Mint 22 (GTK 4.14), enable the
pkg.cinnamon.nowayland build profile:

    DEB_BUILD_PROFILES=pkg.cinnamon.nowayland dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc

Use the same profile when installing build dependencies. This omits
GTK4 Layer Shell and disables the Wayland backend and session files.

CI selects this profile for Mint 22 through debian/build-profiles.mint22.

The Mint 22 CI job validates a complete package build only. Installing the
resulting master packages additionally requires runtime dependency backports
(notably python3-xkbcommon and the split NetworkManager packages), which are
not provided by this profile. LMDE 7 and Mint 27 CI also install the packages.
